{"unit_id":"asfre__dsh-mcp-global-manager#card-zh","repo":"asfre/dsh-mcp-global-manager","commit":"17e9d2571eb01fa30c94e566195a208327870fff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-global-manager 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面端的 MCP 配置管理插件。它在 DSH 侧栏提供管理面板，并通过本机接口扫描已知开发工具中的 MCP 配置，比较新增、变更和已消失的条目。用户可以把选中的服务加入 DSH，直接新增、编辑、启用或停用 DSH 中的服务，也可以在授权后把条目同步回原工具，并管理自定义扫描源和备份。适合希望在多个工具之间集中整理 MCP 服务的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH 宿主提供 webServer 能力，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:25-40","cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:428-848","lib/client.js:3038-3046","lib/scan.js:224-316","lib/sync.js:1-80"]}
{"unit_id":"asfre__dsh-mcp-global-manager#card-en","repo":"asfre/dsh-mcp-global-manager","commit":"17e9d2571eb01fa30c94e566195a208327870fff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mcp-global-manager scans local tools for MCP configs and shows new, changed, or missing servers in a DSH sidebar. Users can adopt entries into DSH, manage DSH servers, and sync linked entries back to their source. It supports custom sources and requires a DSH host with webServer.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:25-40","cordis.patch.yml:1-5","lib/index.js:428-848","lib/client.js:3038-3046","lib/scan.js:224-316","lib/sync.js:1-80"]}
